<!--
  One entry, deliberately.

  The app holds its screen in React state rather than in the URL (see
  `src/app/useAppNavigation.ts`), so `/` is the only address that resolves.
  Listing a `/team/lv` here would advertise pages that return the same document
  and get dropped as duplicates — worse than not listing them.

  Keep the host in step with SITE_URL in src/shared/config/site.ts.
-->
